      "created_at": "2020-03-15T13:23:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>...Wait, it's not Monday though. c.c What the heck.</p>\n<p>Well, this wasn't too bad, honestly. The&nbsp;heavy defense team took a while to get going, but they've got plenty of area attacks, and of course the environment was there to speed things along. Word to the wise, take out the lightning dome if you want things to go even faster, there's a lot of lightning damage being flung at the villains in this game.</p>\n<p>Argent Adept of all people finished things off with a dual Syncopated Onslaught to Sergeant Steel.</p>",
