      "username": "QuirkyDM",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/quirkydm/{size}/2033_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-03-16T11:22:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Pretty easy mint. Writhe and Argent Adept kept 3 out of the 4 heroes isolated every turn, which greatly helped to reduce loss of health. Focused on Miss Information first as she was the biggest threat and causes the most problems with the team. The heroes completely ignored the mass gatherings at&nbsp;Sergeant Steel's base until the end of the game when everything had run its course and it was safe to venture out again.</p>",
