    {
      "id": 229978,
      "name": "bolnerap",
      "username": "bolnerap",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bolnerap/{size}/6056_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-03-16T23:57:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I also had a pretty easy time, everyone finished at max HP except O-U at 20.</p>\n<p>Writhe was a total powerhouse. He protected Visionary for a while until he got a bunch of cards, the Cloak, and Umbral Siphon out, then he kept using his \"select a target, +1 damage to that target, use a power\" to burn people down and stop Steel's healing. When Visionary turtled up or he got an extra&nbsp;power, he usually protected himself.</p>\n<p>AA mostly kept himself healed up and passed power uses as appropriate using Harp / Supertonic.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;O-U didn't get to do a whole lot, but I eventually had two Innervation Rays out, so that was something.</p>\n<p>Visionary got Demoralization/Cocoon out and soaked damage while plinking away.</p>\n<p>KO order: Ermine, Steel, Miss Information, La Capitan.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:04:51.801Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
