      "read": false,
      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I also had a pretty easy time, everyone finished at max HP except O-U at 20.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Writhe was a total powerhouse. He protected Visionary for a while until he got a bunch of cards, the Cloak, and Umbral Siphon out, then he kept using his \"select a target, +1 damage to that target, use a power\" to burn people down and stop Steel's healing. When Visionary turtled up or he got an extra&nbsp;power, he usually protected himself.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>AA mostly kept himself healed up and passed power uses as appropriate using Harp / Supertonic.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;O-U didn't get to do a whole lot, but I eventually had two Innervation Rays out, so that was something.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Visionary got Demoralization/Cocoon out and soaked damage while plinking away.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>KO order: Ermine, Steel, Miss Information, La Capitan.</p>",
