      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "I originally tried to focus on SS, but Hold the Line kept [color=green]**Removed by Mod**[/color]&nbsp;coming up.\n\nTook out Ermine, then started on SS, bought him down low and kicked MI below 4, and the environment killed both of them in the same turn.\n\nThen La Capitan gulped when Chiquito was eaten by Writhe and he repeatedly stabbed her with the Umbral Siphon.\n",
