      "created_at": "2020-03-17T15:44:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Otherwise I had them on high lock down with Writhe protecting Omnitron and Visionary every turn (power + argetnt's ability) + argent was healing 2 HP a turn. I thought I had it in he bag easy...</p>\n<p>Then... Levithian came out</p>\n<p>Before Omnitron's turn (who had the destroy an enviroment power) Miss Information played the \"hero's cannot use power card\" and levithian smacked us all in the face for 4 damage... then Ermine destroyed Omnitron's destory enviroment power... Then Miss information made Writhe (who had about half his deck in his hand) discard all one shot's sending him down to 2 cards which also included his destroy enviroment card... so Levithian got to smack us again again the next turn.... I only stopped him because Argent finally pulled his destory enviroment power... But meanwhile while I was dealing with this combination of Earmine + La Camadora had cleaned out Omnitron's and visonary's hand, and had destroyred all of theri stuff...</p>\n<p>It's been awhile since things have turned south so quickly for me... Got the Mint, but I came out with a nearly dead party.&nbsp;</p>",
