      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/838e76/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-03-20T21:41:34.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Interesting match. The game went 3-4 rounds with zero damage dealt to the villains, but the villains didn't have much offense and the heroes had great defense.</p>\n<p>The dynamic turned in an instant when Judge Mental came out, with Twist the Ether and two Coil Blasters on Omnitron. It ripped Miss Information and Ermine apart in two rounds. Steel wasn't far behind, and a huge Self-Sabotage explosion took out La Cap after Writhe had hidden the stupid anthropoid.</p>",
